cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this challenge, cite the archived dataset and the WSI-DICOM Bench software."
title: "WSI-DICOM Core Profile Negative Bench"
type: dataset
version: "unreleased"
authors:
  - name: "WSI-DICOM Bench contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/frames-sg/wsi-dicom"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A frozen engineered challenge set for detection and rule/domain localization of known DICOM 2026c
  core-profile VL Whole Slide Microscopy pixel, geometry, color, identity, compression, and conformance defects.
keywords:
  - DICOM
  - whole-slide imaging
  - digital pathology
  - conformance
  - validation
  - negative testing
